---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BlogLayout from '../../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro';
const posts = (await getCollection('blogZh', ({ data }) => !data.draft)).sort((a, b) => b.data.date.valueOf() - a.data.date.valueOf());
---
<BlogLayout title="博客 | Dongming Zhao, LCSW" description="赵东明（Dongming Zhao，LCSW）分享的心理健康、关系与自我理解文章。" path="/zh/blog/" lang="zh-Hans">
  <section class="page-hero blog-hero"><div class="wrap reveal"><span class="eyebrow">博客与资源</span><h1>关于理解自己、关系与生活的思考。</h1><hr class="rule" /><p class="lede lede--wide">中英文文章各自独立发布；只有在对应译文已发布时，文章页才会显示语言切换。</p><p class="blog-language"><a href="/blog/" lang="en">Read articles in English →</a></p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--band"><div class="wrap blog-list">{posts.length ? posts.map((post) => <article class="blog-card reveal"><p class="blog-date"><time datetime={post.data.date.toISOString()}>{post.data.date.toLocaleDateString('zh-CN', { dateStyle: 'long' })}</time></p><h2><a href={`/zh/blog/${post.data.slug}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h2><p class="lede">{post.data.description}</p><a class="btn btn--text" href={`/zh/blog/${post.data.slug}/`}>阅读全文 →</a></article>) : <p>目前还没有已发布的文章，欢迎稍后再来。</p>}</div></section>
</BlogLayout>
